00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:36.190
I'm carrying the fate of the Miyamoto group on my shoulder.

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:39.860
It's so cold...

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:44.460
But if we don't save some money, we can't pay the bills.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:46.930
Welcome back!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.620
That was a long bath.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:03.930
We will finally kill Inuzuka Koushi tonight...

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.230
Die, Inuzuka Koushi, for the sake of our clan!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.080
Die, damn you!

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.470
What? He dodged it?

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.420
A pen...

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.690
Shit! Jaei Anki!

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:57.670
Damn you, let me go, let me go!

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:00.390
Damn you, feigning sleep like that!

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:02.470
I'm stuck...

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:04.860
I like you...

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:13.650
I like you, I have fallen for you, I love you.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.520
Wh... Wh... Wh... Wh...

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.140
Shut up!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:21.220
