00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:43.470
I mean...

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.290
But...

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.760
Yo... You see...

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.470
Like...

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:48.940
Doing something like this all of a sudden...

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:49.970
Hey...

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.000
Uh...

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.590
I mean...

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.570
You see...

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.700
