00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:22.460
Ko... Koushi-dono! What happened!?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.420
What's that on your face?

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:29.780
How would I know?

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:35.200
NO!!!

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.400
Sis!

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:41.100
NO!!!

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:44.810
We will crush the Miyamoto group this time for sure!

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:49.900
NO!!!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.720
Wait for me, sis!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.810
I see... He...

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.380
...has fallen for me.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.050
For me...

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:08.980
Sis... How was the assassination?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:12.140
Was Inuzuka's assassination a success?

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.220
Inuzuka Koushi's...

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.300
