00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.550
What!?

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.470
Let's go with plan B!

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:27.740
Plan B...?

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.660
Sis...

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:38.580
Momoko, I like you, I like you!

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.680
I have fallen for you, I love you!

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.170
What is this?

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:46.490
Please forgive me, I couldn't help myself...

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:48.210
I'll rock you senseless.

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:17.200
